        <div class="right">
<p style="font-size:19px">Subscribe to updates</p>
<p>Please subscribe to stay updated with the latest API and webhook updates.</p>
<form id="subscription-form" style="display:flex;">
  <input type="email" name="email" value="" placeholder="Enter your email" required style="width: 20em;padding: 10px; margin-right: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px;"><button id="subscribe-btn" class="button button-green subscribe-btn" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
</form>
