  <tr>
    <td>Deprecation of User V1 APIs and Events</td>
    <td>User V1 APIs for <a href="#list-all-users">List all Users</a>, <a href="#retrieve-a-user">Retrieve a User</a>, <a href="#create-a-user">Create a User</a> and <a href="#update-a-user">Update a User</a> as well as <a href="#user-events-v1">User V1 events</a> will be deprecated and replaced by User V2 APIs and Events.</td>
    <td>25-02-2026</td>
