    </td>
    <td>30-09-2026</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Deprecation of <code>realtime_transcription</code> endpoint</td>
    <td>The <a href="#retrieve-realtime-transcription">realtime_transcription</a> endpoint is in its deprecation phase. As the deadline is approaching, update/migrate to <a href="#retrieve-a-transcription">transcription</a> endpoint as soon as possible, to avoid service disruption.</td>
