<code> action_item.created</code>  - informs about action item has been created.</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>05-07-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#retrieve-action-items">retrieve action items</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#action_item-created">action_item.created</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>Added whatsapp channel to message webhook events</td>
    <td>Added whatsapp channel to message webhook events i.e.
    <ul>
        <li><code> message.sent</code></li>
        <li><code> message.received</code></li>
        <li><code> message.status_updated</code></li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>06-04-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#message-sent">Message sent</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#message-received">Message received</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#message-status_updated">Message status updated</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New Conversation Intelligence endpoint and webhook</td>
    <td>New endpoint and webhook is available to use Conversation Intelligence capabilities:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> Retrieve a playbook result</code> - Fetch playbook result for a call.</li>
        <li>
<code> playbook_result.created</code>  - informs about a playbook result has been created.</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>07-23-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#retrieve-a-playbook-result">retrieve a playbook result</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#playbook_result-created">playbook_result.created</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
    <tr>
    <td>New participant type in Transcription endpoint and webhook</td>
    <td>Voice virtual agent is available to use on Conversation Intelligence capabilities:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> Retrieve a transcription</code> - Fetch call transcription for a call via API.</li>
        <li>
<code> transcription.created</code>  - informs about availability of call transcription.</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>07-23-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#retrieve-a-transcription">retrieve a transcription</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#transcription-created">transcription.created</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New Conversation Intelligence webhook event</td>
    <td>New webhook event is available for Conversation Intelligence:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> playbook_result.updated</code>  - informs about a playbook result has been updated.</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>07-24-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#playbook_result-updated">playbook_result.updated</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New AI Voice Agent webhook events</td>
    <td>Three new webhook events are available for AI Voice Agent interactions:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> ai_voice_agent.started</code> - indicates that a call handled by AI Voice Agent has initiated/started</li>
        <li>
<code> ai_voice_agent.ended</code> - indicates that a call handled by AI Voice Agent has ended</li>
        <li>
<code> ai_voice_agent.escalated</code> - indicates that a call handled by AI Voice Agent has been escalated to a human agent</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>08-28-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#ai_voice_agent-started">ai_voice_agent.started</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#ai_voice_agent-ended">ai_voice_agent.ended</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#ai_voice_agent-escalated">ai_voice_agent.escalated</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New Realtime Transcription endpoint</td>
    <td>New endpoint is available for Conversation Intelligence capabilities:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> Retrieve realtime transcription</code> - Fetch realtime transcription for a call.</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>10-08-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#retrieve-realtime-transcription">Retrieve realtime transcription</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New Real-time Transcription webhook event</td>
    <td>New webhook event is available for Real-time Transcription:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> realtime_transcription.utterances_received</code> - delivers utterances in real-time during active calls.</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>10-08-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#realtime_transcription-utterances_received">realtime_transcription.utterances_received</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New AI Voice Agent webhook event</td>
    <td>New webhook event is available for AI Voice Agent interactions:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> ai_voice_agent.summary</code> - delivers answers to configured intake questions after end of voice-agent call. This event is only generated if the voice-agent succeeds in extracting the answers.</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>10-30-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#ai_voice_agent-summary">ai_voice_agent.summary</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New Custom Summary webhook events</td>
    <td>Two new webhook events are available for Custom Summaries:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code> custom_summary.result_created</code> - sent when a custom summary result is generated for a call</li>
        <li>
<code> custom_summary.result_updated</code> - sent when a custom summary result is updated for a call</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>07-11-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#custom_summary-result_created">custom_summary.result_created</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#custom_summary-result_updated">custom_summary.result_updated</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New Custom Summary API endpoint</td>
    <td>New API endpoint is available to retrieve custom summary results:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code>GET /v1/calls/:call_id/custom_summary_result</code> - retrieves the custom summary result for a specific call</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>13-11-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#retrieve-a-custom-summary-result">Retrieve a custom summary result</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>New Call Evaluations API endpoint</td>
    <td>New API endpoint is available to retrieve call evaluations:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code>GET /v1/calls/:call_id/evaluations</code> - retrieves call evaluations for a specific call</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>17-12-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#retrieve-call-evaluations">Retrieve call evaluations</a><a></a>
</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
    <tr>
    <td>New Call Evaluations Webhook Events</td>
    <td>Two new webhook events are available for Call Evaluations:
      <ul>
        <li>
<code>call_evaluation.created</code> - sent when a call evaluation is created</li>
        <li>
<code>call_evaluation.updated</code> - sent when a call evaluation is updated</li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>17-12-2025</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li>
<a href="#call_evaluation-created">call_evaluation.created</a><a></a>
</li>
        <li>
<a href="#call_evaluation-updated">call_evaluation.updated</a><a></a>
</li>
    <tr>
    <td>New User V2 Webhook Events</td>
    <td>New User V2 webhook events are available. These events provide the same functionality as User events but with an updated payload structure. The User V2 events do not include the <code>numbers</code> array in the response. Eight new webhook events are available.
    </td>
    <td>01-20-2026</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#user-events-v2">user webhook events v2</a></li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
    </ul>
</td>
</tr>
    <tr>
    <td>New User V2 APIs</td>
    <td>New User V2 API endpoints are now available. These endpoints provide the same functionality as User APIs V1 but with an updated payload structure. The User V2 endpoints do not include the <code>numbers</code> array in the response.Five new APIs are available.
    <ul>
     <li> New API to list all numbers for a user is now available.</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td>01-20-2026</td>
    <td>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#user-v2">user v2 APIs</a></li>
         <li><a href="#list-all-numbers-for-a-user-v2">List all Numbers for a User V2</a></li>
      </ul>
    </td>
    <td>N/A</td>
  </tr>
