<!-- Description -->

<p>Send a group message with text or multimedia from a public api configured number.</p>

<p>Numbers not configured won't be able to send group conversations via API. Number can be configured from <a href="#create-number-configuration">here</a>.</p>

<p>This endpoint does not support sending both media and a text body in the same request; use one or the other.</p>

<p>Group messaging supports up to 10 participants total per group conversation, including the sender.</p>
<!-- URL -->

      
    <!-- Response -->

      
    <!-- Query fields table -->

