<p><q class="notice">
  If wrap up time is set as zero and have mandatory call tagging enabled, <code>user.wut_end</code> event will be sent if user tags the call at the end of the call. However if call was tagged during the call(having mandatory call tagging enabled), the event would not be sent.
</q></p>
<!-- Webhook payload -->

      
    
